{"id":"f2940633bae35b52","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-ta-not-re.md","title":"True Arithmetic Not RE","display":"prop-ta-not-re — True Arithmetic Not RE","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-ta-not-re","aliases":["92-prop-ta-not-re"],"display":"prop-ta-not-re — True Arithmetic Not RE","depends_on":["[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 24–26；第 X 章 p. 114（PDF 41–43、131）","source_status":"原书真集不可算术表达的本地 c.e. 推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-ta-not-re"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-ta-not-re</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ta-not-re — True Arithmetic Not RE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aca515b20bf2fbd3\" href=\"?note=aca515b20bf2fbd3\" title=\"92-thm-tarski-undefinability\">92-thm-tarski-undefinability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 24–26；第 X 章 p. 114（PDF 41–43、131）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书真集不可算术表达的本地 c.e. 推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> (true arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel codes of true arithmetic sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ta\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{CE}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ta\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{CE}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span>（真算术）不是递归可枚举的</li>\n<li>若真算术句码为 c.e.，标准有限计算记录的算术化给出一个 Σ₁ 公式在标准模型中表达该码集，直接违背语义 Tarski 不可定义定理</li>\n<li>由于句子否定的编码变换可计算，真算术若是co-r.e.也会是r.e.</li>\n<li>Tarski不可定义定理排除同一算术语言中的全真谓词；它不表示元语言中不能把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span>定义为标准模型真句集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}\\)</span>是不可判定的，也不是r.e.或co-r.e.</li>\n<li>“不是co-r.e.”使用真算术的否定完备性及句子否定码的可计算性：若假句码可枚举，逐项取否定便会枚举真句码</li>\n</ul>\n<p>证明采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aca515b20bf2fbd3\" href=\"?note=aca515b20bf2fbd3\" title=\"92-thm-tarski-undefinability\">92-thm-tarski-undefinability</a> 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a> 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa\" href=\"?note=1003ce3e4d1c6eaa\" title=\"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable\">92-thm-godel-set-undecidable</a> 擅自实例化为真算术。</p>\n<p>若补码集 c.e.，先用句子码的可判定性剔除非法句子码，再对每个假句码计算否定码，就枚举全部真句码，亦矛盾。“不是 co-c.e.”因而还用到了非法码过滤和否定码变换，而非单纯把 n 的集合补写成句子否定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条在给定有效句码下用标准 c.e.→Σ₁ 正常形背景。没有从某个独立句的存在直接跳到真算术不可枚举，也没有把相容性当作标准可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"aca515b20bf2fbd3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"aca515b20bf2fbd3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明采用 [[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 [[92-df-ce-set]] 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 [[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]] 擅自实例化为真算术。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明采用 [[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 [[92-df-ce-set]] 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 [[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]] 擅自实例化为真算术。","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明采用 [[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 [[92-df-ce-set]] 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 [[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]] 擅自实例化为真算术。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ta\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{CE}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{TA}_G)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}","display":false}],"bytes":2605,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"re